# v0.16.0: the test suite's comment strippers and brace-counting extractor
# assume LF files; CRLF checkouts silently defeat them (JS `.` does not match
# \r, so `/\/\/.*$/` fails to strip comments and static asserts misfire).
# Force LF in the working tree on every platform.
* text=auto
*.js  text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.py  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
